{%- doc -%}
  Renders the Black Friday offer line for a product: the shopper's saving when
  the variant is discounted, and the shipping offer alone when it is not.

  Rendered inside the section's `Price-{section}-{product}` element on purpose.
  On a variant change theme.js re-fetches the section and swaps only a fixed
  list of regions by id — Price among them, a custom block not. Anywhere else
  the saving would keep the previous variant's figure after a switch, which is
  a wrong discount claim rather than a cosmetic bug.

  The saving is computed exactly as product-price.liquid computes its own
  "Save" figure, down to the currency-code setting and the round, so the two
  numbers on the page can never disagree. Keep them in step.

  CAMPAIGN COPY, ends 30 November 2026. The dates are deliberately literal
  rather than locale keys: the offer is single-run English copy, and keys would
  need a matching entry in all 32 locale files to satisfy theme check while
  Shopify already falls back to English. Delete this snippet and its two
  render tags in main-product.liquid when the sale ends.

  @param {object} product - Product to describe.
  @param {object} [variant] - Variant to price. Defaults to the product's selected or first available.

  @example
  {% render 'black-friday-promo', product: product %}
{%- enddoc -%}

{%- liquid
  assign bf_target = variant | default: product.selected_or_first_available_variant

  comment
    A gift card is not part of a sitewide discount and ships nothing, so
    neither half of the message is true of one.
  endcomment
  assign bf_show = true
  if product.gift_card?
    assign bf_show = false
  endif
  if bf_target == blank
    assign bf_show = false
  endif
-%}

{%- if bf_show -%}
  {%- liquid
    assign bf_compare_at = bf_target.compare_at_price
    assign bf_price = bf_target.price

    assign bf_on_sale = false
    if bf_compare_at > bf_price
      assign bf_on_sale = true
    endif

    if bf_on_sale
      assign bf_saved_value = bf_compare_at | minus: bf_price
      if settings.currency_code_enabled
        assign bf_saved_money = bf_saved_value | money_with_currency
      else
        assign bf_saved_money = bf_saved_value | money
      endif
      assign bf_saved_pct = bf_saved_value | times: 100.0 | divided_by: bf_compare_at | round
    endif
  -%}
  <p
    class="bf-promo text-sm font-medium leading-tight"
    style="margin-block-start: var(--sp-2d5); color: rgb(var(--color-success-text));"
  >
    {%- if bf_on_sale -%}
      Black Friday Sale - You&rsquo;re saving {{ bf_saved_money }} ({{ bf_saved_pct }}%) on this item + FREE SHIPPING on orders over $100. Ends Monday 30 Nov &mdash; or when stock runs out.
    {%- else -%}
      Black Friday FREE SHIPPING on orders over $100. Ends Monday 30 Nov &mdash; or when stock runs out.
    {%- endif -%}
  </p>
{%- endif -%}
